WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.279
Lab 2 runs the same steps on the
export from Module 2's Lab 2,

2
00:00:04.279 --> 00:00:05.988
on the assessment host.

3
00:00:05.988 --> 00:00:07.549
The authors haven't run it.

4
00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:12.031
You replace the report folder with Module
2's, and the reviews and exceptions

5
00:00:12.031 --> 00:00:16.725
files with your own copies of the kit's
two templates, filled for your test tenant.

6
00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:20.900
Step one normalizes the export
and lists the dispositions.

7
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:24.175
Step two writes the register,
with your exceptions.

8
00:00:24.175 --> 00:00:28.575
Step three is a comparison by eye:
open the report's pillar tabs.

9
00:00:28.575 --> 00:00:32.311
Every failed and investigate test
should have a register entry,

10
00:00:32.311 --> 00:00:33.862
and no skipped test should.

11
00:00:33.862 --> 00:00:36.812
Note any unrouted test
for your program lead.

12
00:00:36.812 --> 00:00:38.312
Step four backs it out.

13
00:00:38.312 --> 00:00:41.032
The outputs hold your
test tenant's results,

14
00:00:41.032 --> 00:00:43.510
so delete them when you finish Module 4.
